1
00:02:00,396 --> 00:02:02,396


2
00:02:02,420 --> 00:02:03,500
[[NO AUDIO]]

3
00:02:15,630 --> 00:02:18,120
The King of Fiango has arrived!

4
00:02:22,020 --> 00:02:24,220
The White Wolves look magnificent.

5
00:02:24,590 --> 00:02:29,240
Well, it's the hunting competition hosted by Princess Sapphire today. Quite a prize!

6
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:31,140
I heard it's made entirely of gold.

7
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:37,180
Incredible, golden armor! So whoever catches the most game gets to keep it.

8
00:02:38,584 --> 00:02:41,400
The King of Polgarland!

9
00:02:44,964 --> 00:02:46,840
Lord Armor has arrived!

10
00:02:48,550 --> 00:02:55,140
The Foalun brothers of Foalun! The Grand Duke of Gargan!

11
00:02:56,924 --> 00:03:01,780
Next, Prince Franz of Goldland!

12
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,960
Grand Duke of Bosnaria!

13
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:26,240
Maybe this one. Or a brighter color? I like this shape. White is nice too.

14
00:03:26,684 --> 00:03:29,320
She's been at it for an hour already.

15
00:03:42,610 --> 00:03:45,920
Oh, today's hunt will be grand! The absolute best!

16
00:03:48,820 --> 00:03:50,980
That's Duke Duralumin.

17
00:03:55,330 --> 00:03:59,780
I come from Union X. I have a favor to ask of you.

18
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:05,040
This is a gift from Union X. Please accept it.

19
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:08,020
And what do you want me to do?

20
00:04:08,740 --> 00:04:10,860
It's simple, Prince Franz.

21
00:04:17,710 --> 00:04:19,800
Um, is Princess Sapphire here yet?

22
00:04:20,485 --> 00:04:22,300
She is currently changing.

23
00:04:25,605 --> 00:04:28,270
I'll go with this one after all. Oh, hello, Franz!

24
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,220
Welcome, Franz.

25
00:04:30,390 --> 00:04:31,980
Welcome, Prince Franz.

26
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:36,820
Just kidding. Doesn't look like Prince Franz after all.

27
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,760
How dare you trick me!

28
00:04:42,980 --> 00:04:47,480
Sorry, sorry, sorry, sorry! It was just a joke! Wait, Tink!

29
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:51,400
Princess Sapphire!

30
00:04:52,970 --> 00:04:53,970
Franz!

31
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,680
Are you alright?

32
00:04:55,900 --> 00:04:56,100
Yes.

33
00:04:56,455 --> 00:04:57,720
Thank you so much for inviting me today.

34
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:05,860
(Laughter)

35
00:05:14,820 --> 00:05:16,980
Okay! Let's start!

36
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:55,300
This sentence is the name of the Prince of Franz.

37
00:05:55,860 --> 00:05:57,140
When the Prince reads this sentence, he is reading his own name.

38
00:05:57,300 --> 00:06:03,600
I am reading his name. But word has it that Goldland's horse looks impressive, but can't run at all...

39
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:10,860
No way, that can't be true. Then how about a race to the swamp?

40
00:06:12,650 --> 00:06:17,060
Alright, let's do it! Franz, don't worry, we definitely won't lose!

41
00:06:17,810 --> 00:06:18,840
Let me go, Lord Nylon!

42
00:06:30,870 --> 00:06:32,900
Now it's your turn!

43
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,680
Go!

44
00:06:50,850 --> 00:06:52,860
Wow, what a huge place.

45
00:06:58,300 --> 00:07:02,340
Oh, Prince Franz and Nylon. Where are they going?

46
00:07:02,875 --> 00:07:04,300
Alright, let me follow them.

47
00:07:13,230 --> 00:07:14,280
Taking the right path. Yah!

48
00:07:19,075 --> 00:07:22,980
Too bad for you. That's a graveyard. You fell right into our trap.

49
00:07:38,380 --> 00:07:41,780
Look, the black hawk is here. It's the signal. Go inform Lord Gagor.

50
00:07:41,980 --> 00:07:42,980
Got it.

51
00:07:48,090 --> 00:07:51,820
Come in. What is it?

52
00:07:52,140 --> 00:07:53,240
The signal hawk has arrived.

53
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:57,320
I see. It's here.

54
00:07:59,385 --> 00:08:03,140
Foolish brat. Poor Franz.

55
00:08:03,490 --> 00:08:05,820
Pitiful Goldland.

56
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:09,280
(crying)

57
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,620
There's the signal! Begin!

58
00:08:18,690 --> 00:08:20,460
Alright! Start talking!

59
00:08:45,289 --> 00:08:48,400
How odd, there's no swamp here. Isn't this a graveyard?

60
00:09:36,615 --> 00:09:38,820
AAAAAAAH!

61
00:09:44,980 --> 00:09:48,520
And that's how it's done. I am the greatest hunter in the world.

62
00:09:48,700 --> 00:09:52,980
No, no, you're not the world's best hunter. I am!

63
00:09:55,055 --> 00:09:58,620
No, I am! I caught thirty of them!

64
00:10:00,979 --> 00:10:03,480
It's me! I caught a bear this huge!

65
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:05,960
It's me!

66
00:10:06,620 --> 00:10:07,620
Me!

67
00:10:08,620 --> 00:10:09,920
I wonder what happened to Franz?

68
00:10:10,340 --> 00:10:11,340
Prince Sapphire!

69
00:10:13,079 --> 00:10:14,760
Prince Sapphire, I have returned.

70
00:10:15,580 --> 00:10:16,180
And Franz?

71
00:10:16,460 --> 00:10:22,160
That clumsy prince lost the horse race to me and ran back crying to Goldland.

72
00:10:22,545 --> 00:10:26,080
That Franz is truly all show and no spine.

73
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:32,040
No way...

74
00:10:42,100 --> 00:10:42,460
(Laughter)

75
00:10:42,809 --> 00:10:44,780
Today's hunt was truly delightful.

76
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:46,160
Indeed, indeed.

77
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:48,620
Yes, your marksmanship is quite impressive.

78
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:50,840
No, you were splendid as well.

79
00:10:51,280 --> 00:10:51,640
(Laughter)

80
00:10:51,640 --> 00:10:52,860
Yes, it really was wonderful.

81
00:10:53,060 --> 00:10:55,680
Still, we can't just keep enjoying ourselves forever. Hm?

82
00:10:56,250 --> 00:10:59,040
General! Are you aware of Union X?

83
00:10:59,380 --> 00:11:00,380
Union X?

84
00:11:00,820 --> 00:11:01,920
I have seen it with my own eyes.

85
00:11:02,459 --> 00:11:07,520
It was truly dreadful. Before long, they will surely reach our lands as well.

86
00:11:11,340 --> 00:11:19,340
One day, every single tree and blade of grass across the country withered away. With no plants left, the people starved.

87
00:11:20,040 --> 00:11:28,040
That is when Union X strikes. They burn down homes and slaughter people indiscriminately. It all happens in an instant.

88
00:11:28,619 --> 00:11:33,220
Word is they possess countless deadly weapons the likes of which we've never seen.

89
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:49,320
And the food distributed afterward is laced with a drug that strips away the will to fight or think, leaving people with no spirit to do anything—slaves to Union X.

90
00:11:51,014 --> 00:11:54,300
That is Union X: a terrifying organization.

91
00:11:55,530 --> 00:11:56,860
Who on earth could they be?

92
00:11:56,880 --> 00:12:00,940
Speaking of which, the King of Garban, standing in for my nation, doesn't seem to be in top form today.

93
00:12:01,155 --> 00:12:03,600
Where will they come from first?

94
00:12:04,165 --> 00:12:06,720
That was quite a terrifying maneuver.

95
00:12:26,389 --> 00:12:29,620
Franz, I know it's a lie that you ran away.

96
00:12:30,650 --> 00:12:33,020
But where did you go?

97
00:12:36,820 --> 00:12:37,820
Sapphire!

98
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,320
Ah, Jin!

99
00:12:40,420 --> 00:12:47,380
Prince Franz is in trouble! Your wicked grandmother took him to the graveyard past the forest.

100
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:48,940
Jin, lead the way!

101
00:12:58,200 --> 00:13:02,540
[[NO AUDIO]]

102
00:13:17,939 --> 00:13:26,260
Heh heh heh... Goldland is already as good as in the hands of Union X.

103
00:13:26,560 --> 00:13:32,480
And when this underground empire is complete, we will crush Silverland with our own hands.

104
00:13:36,819 --> 00:13:42,360
Are you awake? This time, you will sleep forever...

105
00:13:44,920 --> 00:13:45,920
What?

106
00:13:49,400 --> 00:13:57,400
Look above you. A 50-ton block of iron is hanging there by a single thin rope. But in a few minutes, that rope is set to snap.

107
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:01,040
What? What is it?

108
00:14:31,949 --> 00:14:36,200
Ehhhh... I've got an opening!

109
00:14:42,019 --> 00:14:46,320
Is it around here? Let's go deeper in.

110
00:14:53,494 --> 00:14:56,420
Uh-oh. This place looks suspicious.

111
00:14:57,150 --> 00:14:58,150
Someone's coming.

112
00:15:03,114 --> 00:15:06,420
I thought I heard voices... Must be my imagination.

113
00:15:12,654 --> 00:15:13,654
Was that a bit too tight?

114
00:15:19,629 --> 00:15:26,780
Looks like it leads underground... Whoa! Tink!

115
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:31,280
Tink!

116
00:15:35,300 --> 00:15:36,300
Jabaia!

117
00:15:37,294 --> 00:15:38,294
Tink! Are you okay?

118
00:15:41,369 --> 00:15:43,240
Someone's coming! Run, Jabaiya!

119
00:15:44,039 --> 00:15:48,120
I'm sorry, Tink. But if I turn to stone too, it's all over.

120
00:15:49,859 --> 00:15:50,940
Whoa! Who are you?!

121
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:53,440
Whoa! What are you doing?!

122
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:52,080
Good night.

123
00:16:55,379 --> 00:16:59,400
That's what happens when you get soft. Now, get to work!

124
00:17:01,899 --> 00:17:03,560
How terrible...

125
00:17:03,909 --> 00:17:07,619
I see. So these really are the X-Union guys Fugaaf mentioned.

126
00:17:25,389 --> 00:17:27,920
Where on earth are they holding Franz?

127
00:17:28,269 --> 00:17:29,840
Franz, where are you?

128
00:17:43,659 --> 00:17:46,780
Spill it already, pipsqueak!

129
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:50,460
Shut up! I'm Tink, not a pipsqueak!

130
00:17:50,461 --> 00:17:55,520
Whatever. Tell me who came with you. You couldn't have come alone.

131
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:56,800
I see.

132
00:17:57,320 --> 00:18:00,800
Hey, kid. You're the runt who's always following Sapphire around, aren't you?

133
00:18:01,439 --> 00:18:03,880
I'm not following you around! I'm an assistant!

134
00:18:05,759 --> 00:18:09,620
Sapphire? This kills two birds with one stone.

135
00:18:10,520 --> 00:18:16,660
Tighten security around France. Kill anyone suspicious on sight. Got it? Move out!

136
00:18:16,980 --> 00:18:17,980
Yes.

137
00:18:18,439 --> 00:18:24,020
How about I teach you a lesson so you can't talk back, pipsqueak?

138
00:18:33,409 --> 00:18:37,540
That young fool. Showing such courage right after arriving... what a pity.

139
00:18:38,250 --> 00:18:39,250
It's France!

140
00:18:40,559 --> 00:18:43,000
Hey, you two! The captain's calling you!

141
00:18:43,100 --> 00:18:44,100
Got it!

142
00:18:46,040 --> 00:18:47,040
Franz!

143
00:18:47,609 --> 00:18:50,640
Sapphire! Get out of here! This is the X Union's fortress!

144
00:18:51,599 --> 00:18:53,100
Franz! I came to save you!

145
00:18:53,205 --> 00:18:55,420
No! If you linger, you'll be killed!

146
00:18:55,679 --> 00:18:57,380
Don't worry! Leave it to me!

147
00:18:58,625 --> 00:18:59,625
No!

148
00:19:00,260 --> 00:19:01,260
But...

149
00:19:01,609 --> 00:19:02,640
Get out!

150
00:19:06,259 --> 00:19:09,920
What? I called for the captain? I said no such thing!

151
00:19:10,355 --> 00:19:12,980
Damn it! It's Sapphire! She snuck in with that brat!

152
00:19:12,981 --> 00:19:14,000
Hurry, everyone!

153
00:19:23,759 --> 00:19:26,040
Sapphire... please escape safely.

154
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:41,640
Don't worry. Franz is tied up tight.

155
00:19:43,859 --> 00:19:48,380
But where did that liar go? That masked X spy!

156
00:19:48,460 --> 00:19:49,460
Right! Exactly!

157
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:03,300
Princess Knight!

158
00:20:05,109 --> 00:20:06,520
Prince Franz! I've come to help you!

159
00:20:07,159 --> 00:20:08,800
Princess Knight? Get him!

160
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:10,960
Watch out!

161
00:20:12,980 --> 00:20:19,820
Aaaaaah!

162
00:20:19,944 --> 00:20:23,700
[groan]

163
00:20:28,420 --> 00:20:29,820
Ngh!

164
00:20:31,559 --> 00:20:32,559
[noise]

165
00:20:40,669 --> 00:20:42,920
Aha, an intruder!

166
00:20:43,314 --> 00:20:45,320
Go! I don't care if you kill him!

167
00:20:55,660 --> 00:20:56,660
They're cut!

168
00:21:04,099 --> 00:21:07,120
Ah, I'm saved. Thank you, Princess Knight.

169
00:21:07,339 --> 00:21:08,480
Tink has been captured.

170
00:21:08,974 --> 00:21:10,440
Right, let's hurry!

171
00:21:14,780 --> 00:21:16,000
It's Princess Knight!

172
00:21:16,479 --> 00:21:17,880
What, Princess Knight?

173
00:21:18,504 --> 00:21:20,800
I see. We can't leave him alive!

174
00:21:20,900 --> 00:21:21,640
King Noir!

175
00:21:21,900 --> 00:21:22,920
You were in on this too?

176
00:21:26,299 --> 00:21:30,020
That's right, I am Noir. Head of the Blackland division of Union X!

177
00:21:31,240 --> 00:21:34,340
Prince Franz! Let me lure them into the central cave!

178
00:21:34,794 --> 00:21:36,060
We'll blast them to pieces!

179
00:21:41,279 --> 00:21:42,740
Pursue them! Don't let them escape!

180
00:21:49,099 --> 00:21:52,660
Everyone who's been enslaved!

181
00:21:55,304 --> 00:21:57,580
Now is the time to defeat Union X!

182
00:21:58,349 --> 00:22:02,260
That's right! Everyone, lend Princess Knight a hand! We'll strike down Union X!

183
00:22:08,099 --> 00:22:10,200
Damn those slaves!

184
00:22:11,649 --> 00:22:12,340
Mr. Noal!

185
00:22:12,600 --> 00:22:15,660
I'll leave the rest to you! I have to contact headquarters!

186
00:22:28,530 --> 00:22:30,140
[MUSIC]

187
00:22:36,060 --> 00:22:36,560
[MUSIC!]

188
00:22:36,561 --> 00:22:38,420
Whaaaaaat?!

189
00:22:39,470 --> 00:22:40,470
Found it!

190
00:22:43,330 --> 00:22:44,330
[MUSIC]

191
00:22:47,219 --> 00:22:48,760
Hmm?

192
00:22:48,909 --> 00:22:52,780
Take one step and you're dead.

193
00:23:08,980 --> 00:23:11,000
Wait! Dodge!

194
00:23:13,100 --> 00:23:14,100
I'm back.

195
00:23:16,100 --> 00:23:22,980
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8.

196
00:23:23,829 --> 00:23:27,560
Yes, Your Excellency!

197
00:23:29,200 --> 00:23:30,200
(laughs)

198
00:23:31,120 --> 00:23:35,120
Oh, Tink!

199
00:23:35,459 --> 00:23:37,380
Hurry, run! We'll get crushed!

200
00:23:38,295 --> 00:23:39,295
Wait up!

201
00:24:06,485 --> 00:24:08,980
Curse that Knight of the Ribbon for getting in my way!

202
00:24:09,409 --> 00:24:11,720
I am just so furious!

203
00:24:12,829 --> 00:24:19,040
Just watch! One day, Union X will rule Silverland!

204
00:24:30,119 --> 00:24:32,620
The X Union. So the rumors were true.

205
00:24:33,169 --> 00:24:37,800
Don't worry. If anything happens to this kingdom, I'll be the first to come protect you.

206
00:24:38,354 --> 00:24:39,354
Thank you, Franz.

207
00:24:40,359 --> 00:24:43,780
We were saved, all thanks to you. Thank you.

208
00:24:45,225 --> 00:24:46,740
Thank you. Thank you.

209
00:24:48,099 --> 00:24:49,360
You're making me blush.

210
00:24:49,384 --> 00:24:51,384

